/E (The ONL team has tried regular communication via all available channels including WhatsApp, Emails, RCS and social media messages based on market information, successful research calls and offers for every first trade carried out. Parallelly, the ONL team runs financial literacy-based campaigns such as YouTube explainer videos, jargon simplifying newsletters and an active customer support team to answer unique customer queries. The overarching theme of the communication has been the importance of staying invested during an unfavourable market as well, with a focus on compounding and a long-term vision for growing wealth. However, the number of active users has not gone up.    )
